<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: drone command console -->
  <DNX_DroneCommandConsole.label>无人机指挥控制台</DNX_DroneCommandConsole.label>
  <!-- EN: A centralized tactical console for assigning patrol zones to networked drones. It marks a radius-5 command area and orders active Hunter combat drones to move there, patrol the zone, and prioritize threats within it. -->
  <DNX_DroneCommandConsole.description>用于为联网无人机分配巡逻区域的集中式战术控制台。它会标记一个半径5格的指挥区域，并命令活动中的“猎手”战斗无人机前往、巡逻该区域，并优先处理区域内威胁。</DNX_DroneCommandConsole.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Hunter combat drone -->
  <DNX_ExperimentalCombatDrone.label>猎手战斗无人机</DNX_ExperimentalCombatDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: The Hunter is the most common light combat drone in corporate systems, widely used for frontier patrols, facility security, and asset protection. It carries two light machine guns, using strong mobility and persistent tracking to suppress ground infantry, and is especially effective at chasing hostile personnel who leave the battle line or attempt to flank. Its lightweight frame, however, can barely withstand dedicated anti-air fire.\n\nWhen deployed independently, a Hunter autonomously searches for nearby targets. Multiple units can also enable harassment mode to tie down different enemies. Once a drone command console is installed, an operator can coordinate the whole group and order them to rapidly redeploy to a designated area.\n\nCorporate security manuals claim that Hunters significantly reduce patrol workload.\nAn old guard agreed: "We used to have to chase people ourselves."\nHe looked up as three drones flew past, then added, "Now we only have to explain why they chased the wrong people." -->
  <DNX_ExperimentalCombatDrone.description>“猎手”是企业体系中最常见的轻型作战无人机，被广泛用于边境巡逻、设施警戒与资产保卫。它搭载两挺轻机枪，凭借良好的机动性和持续跟踪能力压制地面步兵，尤其擅长追逐脱离阵线或试图绕后的敌对人员；但轻量化机体几乎无法承受专业防空火力。\n\n独立部署时，“猎手”会自主搜索附近目标，多个单位还可启用牵制模式，分别缠住不同敌人；安装无人机总控制台后，操作员则能统一调度机群，命令它们快速转移至指定区域。\n\n企业安保手册称，“猎手”能够显著降低巡逻人员的工作压力。\n一名老警卫对此表示赞同：“以前我们得亲自追人。”\n他抬头看着三架无人机飞过，又补充道：“现在只需要解释为什么它们追错了人。”</DNX_ExperimentalCombatDrone.description>
  
  <!-- EN: crashing experimental drone -->
  <DNX_ExperimentalCombatDroneCrash.label>坠毁的实验无人机</DNX_ExperimentalCombatDroneCrash.label>
  
  <!-- EN: launching Hunter combat drone -->
  <DNX_ExperimentalCombatDroneLaunch.label>发射猎手战斗无人机</DNX_ExperimentalCombatDroneLaunch.label>
  
