  <!-- EN: HAD-09 Ghoul drone bomber bay -->
  <DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.label>HAD-09“恶鬼”无人轰炸机机库</DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.label>
  <!-- EN: The HAD-09 "Ghoul" is a high-altitude unmanned bomber designed for deep strikes and critical-target destruction. Unlike the Hunter, which is built for sustained patrol and close support, the Ghoul does not linger over the battlefield. After target identification, it rapidly enters an attack course, launching micro-missiles at multiple targets inside the selected area or dropping a 500kg-class aerial bomb to devastate fire positions and assembly zones.\n\nAfter completing its mission, it must return to remote airspace for resupply, maintenance, and route reprogramming, so it cannot be called continuously. Against guerrilla forces that lack stable air defense and rely on concealed strongholds, however, the Ghoul usually only needs to appear once to cast the entire area into long-term panic. -->
  <DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.description>HAD-09“恶鬼”是一种面向纵深突袭与关键目标摧毁任务设计的高空无人轰炸机。相比更偏向持续巡逻与近距离支援的“猎手”，“恶鬼”不会长期滞留战场，而是在完成目标识别后快速进入攻击航线，对指定区域内的多个目标发射微型导弹，或投放一枚500公斤级航空炸弹，对火力阵地和集结区域实施毁灭性打击。\n\n完成任务后，它需要返回远端空域进行补给、检修与航线重编，因此无法连续调用；但对于缺乏稳定防空能力、习惯依赖隐蔽据点作战的游击队而言，“恶鬼”通常只需出现一次，就足以让整个区域陷入长期恐慌。</DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.description>
  <!-- EN: prepared HAD-09 -->
  <DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>已备妥的HAD-09</DNX_HAD09GhoulBomberBay.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: prepared HAD-09 -->
