  <!-- EN: JUDGMENT DAY support uplink -->
  <DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.label>“审判日”支援上行链路</DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.label>
  <!-- EN: A tactical support uplink for calling the JUDGMENT DAY super-heavy aerial weapons platform. Hack the control terminal to authorize one platform call. The system re-locks after use and can be hacked again after three days. -->
  <DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.description>用于呼叫“审判日”超重型空中武器平台的战术支援上行链路。破解控制终端即可授权一次平台呼叫。系统会在使用后重新锁定，并可在三天后再次破解。</DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.description>
  <!-- EN: JUDGMENT DAY call authorized. -->
  <DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.hackedInspectString>“审判日”呼叫已授权。</DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.hackedInspectString>
  <!-- EN: {HACKER_labelShort} has authorized {SUBJECT_labelNoParenthesisDef}. -->
  <DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.hackedMessage>{HACKER_labelShort} 已授权 {SUBJECT_labelNoParenthesisDef}。</DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.hackedMessage>
  <!-- EN: Hack to authorize one JUDGMENT DAY call. -->
  <DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.notHackedInspectString>破解后可授权一次“审判日”呼叫。</DNX_HunterKillerSupportSystem.comps.CompHackable.notHackedInspectString>
  
  <!-- EN: Tinker Drone -->
  <DNX_LogisticsDrone.label>修补无人机</DNX_LogisticsDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: A compact autonomous engineering drone that patrols from its dock to repair damaged turrets, replenish turret ammunition, and return to its station when idle. -->
  <DNX_LogisticsDrone.description>一种小型自主工程无人机，会从停靠站出发巡逻，修复受损炮塔、补充炮塔弹药，并在空闲时返回站点。</DNX_LogisticsDrone.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Tinker Drone dock -->
  <DNX_LogisticsDroneDock.label>修补无人机停靠站</DNX_LogisticsDroneDock.label>
  <!-- EN: A compact support platform that launches a Tinker Drone to repair nearby turrets and replenish their ammunition reserves. Requires both low-altitude autonomous navigation and autonomous maintenance doctrine before construction. -->
  <DNX_LogisticsDroneDock.description>一个小型支援平台，可放出修补无人机来修复附近炮塔并补充其弹药储备。建造前需要低空自主导航和自主维护学说。</DNX_LogisticsDroneDock.description>
  
  <!-- EN: mechanoid manta -->
  <DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone.label>机械族蝠鲼</DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: A disposable hostile mechanoid flyer that tracks and attacks colonists and turrets, flying over defensive lines and walls. -->
  <DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone.description>一种一次性的敌对机械族飞行单位，会追踪并攻击殖民者和炮塔，还能飞越防线与墙体。</DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone.description>
  
  <!-- EN: mechanoid bombard manta -->
  <DNX_MechanoidBombardManta.label>机械族轰炸蝠鲼</DNX_MechanoidBombardManta.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy hostile mechanoid flyer that locks a ground position before dropping a high explosive bomb. Mobile targets can evade the strike if they move before the lock completes. -->
  <DNX_MechanoidBombardManta.description>一种重型敌对机械族飞行单位，会先锁定地面位置，再投下高爆炸弹。移动目标如果在锁定完成前离开，就能避开打击。</DNX_MechanoidBombardManta.description>
  
  <!-- EN: crashing mechanoid bombard manta -->
  <DNX_MechanoidBombardMantaCrash.label>坠毁的机械族轰炸蝠鲼</DNX_MechanoidBombardMantaCrash.label>
  
  <!-- EN: crashing mechanoid manta -->
  <DNX_MechanoidMantaCrash.label>坠毁的机械族蝠鲼</DNX_MechanoidMantaCrash.label>
  
  <!-- EN: 实验型采矿无人机 -->
  <DNX_MiningDrone.label>实验型采矿无人机</DNX_MiningDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: 一架用于验证深层矿脉自动采掘流程的实验无人机。它会飞向最近已扫描出的深层矿物并持续采掘，暂未安装内置电量和充电逻辑。 -->
  <DNX_MiningDrone.description>一架用于验证深层矿脉自动采掘流程的实验无人机。它会飞向最近已扫描出的深层矿物并持续采掘，暂未安装内置电量和充电逻辑。</DNX_MiningDrone.description>
  
